From 7457fbdaa74e8927650b0767bd8088724743f968 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@localhost>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:20:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Sua dang nhap tu dong web2api: noi MCP qua thang khoi
 phuc T0-T3, controller that NV92, ma loi rieng

P0: dang_ky_trinh_duyet_that / lay_trinh_duyet_da_dang_ky, chatgpt-web va
gemini-web tra trinh_duyet_none / thu_thach_truoc_khi_dien / het_gio rieng
thay vi chim chung thanh can_nguoi.
P1: cong_mcp_cong_cu._thu_khoi_phuc_tang dua dang_nhap MCP qua
khoi_phuc_theo_tang_c2a; module khong co tang khoi phuc hoac tai khoan
dang nhap qua tai khoan luu khac van giu duong cu (tuyen).
P2: khoa serial T2, cua so hoan captcha theo module, gian cach T2.
Giu nguyen cac cong MCP: allowlist id@module mac dinh rong, mot phien,
nghi 3600s, toi da 3 thanh cong/ngay, khoa sau 2 hong, timeout 300s.
CAPTCHA / selfie / dien thoai / khoa / tap / code khong co TOTP van
dung o can_nguoi, khong co vuot. Khong bia endpoint lam moi cong khai
cho chatgpt-web / gemini-web (tang a chi kiem).
